{"unit_id":"tag:03X8:statement","translation":"（见拓扑（Topologies）定义 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004> 和 <REF_0005>。）设 <MATH_0001>。一个态射族（family of morphisms），在概形（schemes）之间，记为 <MATH_0002>，具有固定目标（target），称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003>-覆盖（covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，当且仅当每个 <MATH_0004> 分别是平坦（flat）的且为有限表示（finite presentation）、句法（syntomic）的、光滑（smooth）的、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的，或<SPACE_0001>开浸入（open immersion），并且有 <MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"固定目标"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"固定目标","context":"保留 fixed 限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
